ices Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0557":{"code":"F-0557","title":"Honor the resident's right to be treated with respect and dignity and to retain and use personal possessions.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0580":{"code":"F-0580","title":"Immediately tell the resident, the resident's doctor, and a family member of situations (injury/decline/room, etc.)  that affect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0584":{"code":"F-0584","title":"Honor the resident's right to a safe, clean, comfortable and homelike environment, including but not limited to receiving treatment and supports for daily living safely.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0585":{"code":"F-0585","title":"Honor the resident's right to voice grievances without discrimination or reprisal and the facility must establish a grievance policy and make prompt efforts to resolve grievances.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0641":{"code":"F-0641","title":"Ensure each resident receives an accurate assessment.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0644":{"code":"F-0644","title":"Coordinate assessments with the pre-admission screening and resident review program; and referring for services as needed.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0645":{"code":"F-0645","title":"PASARR screening for Mental disorders or Intellectual Disabilities","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","con